====Usage notes====
* One of the four [[w:is:Ri-sagnir|ri-verbs]] in Icelandic, the other being {{m|is|núa||to rub, massage; to wipe}}, {{m|is|gróa||to grow; to heal}} and {{m|is|róa||to row}}.
* Even though some forms that include the letter {{m|is|e}} are pronounced as having an [[é]], the e-spelling is thought to be correct by the [[w:is:Menntamálaráðuneyti Íslands|Icelandic ministry of education]]. The preferred spelling of the [[first person]] [[singular]] [[past tense]] [[indicative]] form of the word ''snúa'' would thus be {{m|is|sneri||I turned}} instead of {{m|is|snéri||I turned}}, although both forms are used.

